WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.511
Weaponization and delivery are often paired because one describes preparation of a harmful capability and the other describes movement toward

2
00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:10.861
the target environment.

3
00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:15.266
In this course, those stages stay high level and defensive.

4
00:00:15.416 --> 00:00:22.224
The useful defender view is about reducing the chance that suspicious content reaches users or systems,

5
00:00:22.374 --> 00:00:26.204
and improving the chance that attempted delivery is noticed.

6
00:00:26.354 --> 00:00:32.312
Email security controls, attachment handling, web filtering, application allowlisting, supplier review, safe file handling,

7
00:00:32.462 --> 00:00:35.015
and user reporting all matter here.

8
00:00:35.165 --> 00:00:37.365
So does telemetry.

9
00:00:37.515 --> 00:00:44.749
If a suspicious file is blocked, a user reports a message, or an inbound pattern changes suddenly,

10
00:00:44.899 --> 00:00:49.154
the team should have enough context to investigate without guessing.

11
00:00:49.304 --> 00:00:52.709
Delivery is also a human and process problem.

12
00:00:52.859 --> 00:01:01.369
People need an easy way to report suspicious content, and analysts need a reliable way to connect those reports to

13
00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:03.719
logs and control events.

14
00:01:03.869 --> 00:01:08.124
The goal is not to teach how delivery works offensively.

15
00:01:08.274 --> 00:01:15.934
The goal is to help defenders ask whether inbound paths are governed, whether controls are producing usable evidence,

16
00:01:16.084 --> 00:01:22.041
and whether response teams can connect a suspicious delivery signal to later system behavior.

17
00:01:22.191 --> 00:01:25.170
Delivery-focused defense should also include workflow clarity.

18
00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:31.278
When a user reports suspicious content, the team should know where the report goes,

19
00:01:31.428 --> 00:01:39.938
how it is enriched, how similar activity is searched for, and how results are communicated back to the people who

20
00:01:40.088 --> 00:01:42.288
need to act.
